 Black Seamless Tights\, Black Camisole Leotard\; Shoes: Black Ballet Sho
 es\; Makeup: Men's Light Stage Makeup Light Stage Makeup\; Hair: Male: H
 air out of the eyes Female: High Bun\, No Part\; Accessories (BA provide
 s): White Gloves\; Prop (BA provides): White gun\nLight Stage Makeup Ins
 truction Sheet:\n• Powder matching skintone\n• Light brown eye shado
 w applied to the crease with an eye shadow brush\n• Dark Brown/Black e
 yeliner and black mascara. No fake lashes.\n• Blush on the cheeks (be 
 sure to apply plenty so dancer doesn’t look washed out in the stage li
 ghts)\n• Red or Dark Red lipstick\nMen's Stage Makeup:\n• Dark Brown
 /Black eyeliner - apply from corner to corner\n• Brown or tan under ch
 eek bone to create shadow and accentuate the jaw line\n• Brown eye lin
 er around lips and nude/flesh colored lipstick\n• *Men will not look l
 ike they are wearing makeup. It will help the face be seen from the stag
 e.\nDancers of Color may wear flesh tone tights and flesh tone ballet sh
 oes.\nCostume Care Guidelines:\n• Handle costume pieces with care whil
 e changing to prevent damage to delicate fabrics\n• Promptly notify Ba
 llet Arkansas in the event of costume damage at the point of discovery\,
  no matter how significant\n• Never throw costumes or accessories on t
 he floor\, or hang costumes by their elastic straps\n• Refrain from si
 tting on the floor while in costume\n• Do not attempt to alter\, mend\
 , clean\, or launder any costume or accessory\n• Never apply stage mak
 e-up while in costume and shall take great care to refrain from smudging
  make-up on costume during its removal\n• Refrain from the use of spra
 y perfume or cologne while in costume\n• Never wear any garment not as
 signed to cast member\n• Do not handle or consume food or beverage whi
 le in costume\, with the exception of water\n• Do not remove costumes 
 from their assigned dressing rooms or from the theater\n• Remove all b
 obby pins used to secure head pieces and wigs following their use\n• R
